m formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $x={45}^{∘}$ and $y={30}^{∘},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({75}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({45}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡{45}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡{45}^{∘}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-119007/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "213eda96-c41d-5361-9da9-8349617014f1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119007"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141277/selection/f0c2bd5d925ee1ef1b7ee0eb315286445d2b385b93bddea08ad1fcbcfc7ebc22" :answer/id #uuid "5e492097-59eb-5ede-91c0-63f104cead4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141277/selection/368797d5118e1201063d8ae15ba56c1c486308d78c9aee2f8c81df21f6d16087" :answer/id #uuid "f408b04f-d327-5da0-9c90-9b2720231a75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141277/selection/c843592faadf2d42b42dd58ccc28f8a0ffce9bf51591b76fed91e91714507a58" :answer/id #uuid "a9ae4ef0-79d8-5ce1-8e7b-a825ccbe7112" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141277/selection/d6187f76c7170bbd222b52fb66f1715de193943502ea03b462b3dca00220a152" :answer/id #uuid "1e7666f3-f1a5-5c9b-8e81-7a7b0b19c271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :ans